# Spider-Tauri

Desktop web crawler (Tauri v2 + Rust). Read `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` before editing crawler, commands/events, or UI logic.

## Key files

- `src-tauri/src/crawl/` — Rust crawler (BFS, fetch, scraper, robots.txt)
- `src-tauri/src/commands.rs` — Tauri commands
- `src/api.js` — `window.api` bridge
- `src/renderer.js` — UI, CSV export
- `src/index.html` — layout

## After code changes

If behavior, commands/events, constants, data models, deps, or file structure changed — update `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` in the same session (see `docs/DOC_MAINTENANCE.md` checklist). Update the "Останнє оновлення" date in ARCHITECTURE.md.

## Conventions

- Network requests only in Rust.
- New commands/events: update `commands.rs` / emit sites + `api.js` + renderer.
- Match existing style: minimal scope, no over-abstraction.
- UI text is Ukrainian; match unless user requests otherwise.
